@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Play the hop after a duel is won
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Child" as actor
box "Frontend — game" #E0F2FE
  participant "SoloGame or FriendsGame" as session
  participant "MomentPlayer" as player
  participant "DuelPage" as duel
  participant "WorldMapPage" as map
end box
box "Frontend — domain" #E0F2FE
  participant "MomentPlan" as plan
  participant "BrowserSound" as sound
end box
box "Frontend — world" #E0F2FE
  participant "ThreeClassroomRenderer" as renderer
end box
actor -> session : Correct answer; the duel is decided, speech recognition has stopped
session --> player : Moments: answerCorrect, duelWon
player -> plan : for(moment, reduced)
plan --> player : Rows: chime; "You got it!", win cheer and the passport stamp
player -> sound : play(chime)
alt sound is on and the child has touched the page
  sound --> actor : Chime (L2-039 criterion 1)
else muted, or no touch yet
  sound -> sound : Play nothing (L2-039 criteria 2 and 3)
end
player -> duel : Show "= {answer} You got it!"
player -> renderer : play(kid, winCheer)
duel --> actor : "You got it!", then the passport stamp lands in about 250 ms in place of the flash card (L2-033 criterion 7, L2-038 criterion 5)
session --> player : World Map opens; moment travellerHopsOn
alt full motion
  player -> renderer : play(kid, hop)
  renderer --> actor : Kid hops along the dotted path to the next desk
  renderer --> player : Arrived after about 1 second, no more than 1.5 (L2-038 criterion 1)
else the device asks for reduced motion
  player -> renderer : show(new positions), no hop animation
  player -> map : Fade to the new positions
  map --> actor : Fade of 200 ms from one desk to the next, nothing moves across the screen (L2-038 criterion 4)
end
session --> player : Moment countryReached
player -> map : Show "You walk on to {country}!" (L2-034 criterion 3)
map --> actor : Message for about 1.6 seconds
player -> sound : play(jingle)
player --> session : Message has stayed about 1.6 seconds
session --> actor : Duel returns (L2-034 criterion 9); the next flash card flips in within 300 ms (L2-038 criterion 2)
@enduml
